      "title": "The Mythology Of Conscious AI",
      "gist": "Consciousness probably won't arrive with smarter AI, and machines that merely seem conscious already pose real dangers.",
      "question": "Conscious AI — why is it unlikely to arrive just by making machines smarter, and what should we do? (an argued case)"
    },
