      "title": "Why Conscious AI Matters",
      "gist": "Stories, a fired engineer and leading experts have put machine consciousness on the table, and what we believe about it affects machines, our minds and our self-understanding.",
      "question": "Conscious AI — why does it matter whether machines are conscious? (a framing of stakes)"
    },
