        "spya-u6w37a",
        "spya-d9a0wr"
      ],
      "title": "Old Dreams of Artificial Minds",
      "gist": "People have long fantasized about creating artificial humans, and stories of synthetic minds rarely end well, which suggests that real or apparent machine consciousness carries high stakes."
    },
