      "title": "The Temptations Of Conscious AI",
      "gist": "We assume intelligence and consciousness go together because of human biases, language, exponential-growth thinking and techno-rapture fantasies, not because of evidence.",
      "question": "Conscious AI — why are we tempted to think machines could be conscious? (a set of biases)",
      "sourceHeading": "The Temptations Of Conscious AI"
    },
