        "spya-e7fdmb",
        "spya-vs0vpj"
      ],
      "title": "Uncertainty and the Duty Not to Create",
      "gist": "No theory settles what consciousness requires, so we cannot be sure, and deliberately creating conscious machines would be an ethical disaster, with organoids and other technologies a greater worry than LLMs."
    },
