      "title": "Soul Machine",
      "gist": "Clear thinking about conscious AI is urgent, and what matters about us is not a disembodied soul but our living, breathing existence, which machines should not make us forget.",
      "question": "Soul Machine — how should the idea of the soul change how we see AI and ourselves? (a closing reflection)",
